[{"title":"山中歌","author":"王授","text":"山中五月不知暑，午窗梦揖巢与许。\n起来洒洒竹风吹，满地落花莺自语。\n城中酷暑金石流，驰马汗血不少休。\n富贵致身真自娱，何如蚤向山中游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21041,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秒秋寄友人用刘梦得韵","author":"王授","text":"拒霜开欲尽，草阁已深秋。\n物色时俱化，年华水共流。\n庭螀寒入户，寒雁晚横楼。\n知己何寥落，清灯感旧游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21042,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"僧房夜雨","author":"王授","text":"晓寒春袂薄，夜雨过山家。\n翠合一庭草，红销半树花。\n娇莺迁木蚤，轻燕入帘斜。\n稚子闲挑笋，诗僧正煮茶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21043,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初寒自述示元肃","author":"王授","text":"西风吹细雨，短榻怯青绫。\n多病如衰老，清闲似懒僧。\n灶留烧药火，窗废读书灯。\n江上芙蓉发，看花策瘦藤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21044,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"倚杖吟","author":"王授","text":"倚杖出岩扉，秋入荷衣冷。\n清风吹柳条，素月照松顶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21045,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"顾山新居","author":"吴福","text":"竹里逶迤一径开，鸟声花色尽徘徊。\n人人可作山中相，日日当衔手内杯。\n邻父馈来红橘熟，溪童钓得白鱼回。\n醉馀独步寒皋望，疑上孙登古啸台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21046,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浒关道中","author":"吴祥","text":"淼淼官塘路，劳劳客子心。\n鸿声楚天阔，枫叶古祠深。\n时讶移何速，秋怜老不禁。\n何当虎山月，清夜复疏砧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21047,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"奉咏戒庵先生真率蓬窝二首 其一 桂子秋风","author":"李?","text":"月宫千树倚云裁，应待秋来取次开。\n他日风云时际会，满看折得几枝回。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21048,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"奉咏戒庵先生真率蓬窝二首 其二 拳石献笑","author":"李?","text":"一方奇石净堪怜，围绕名花取次妍。\n怪底玲珑可人意，南宫几拜草堂前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21049,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题泗水厅壁","author":"蒋伟","text":"十年奔走宦途忙，赢得须眉鬓发苍。\n竭力仅能修百废，举头何忍见千疮。\n充饥处处惟糠覈，输税家家卖枣桑。\n老我此行归计得，谁将民隐达岩廊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21050,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠守安诗","author":"蒋伟","text":"高卧沧江有逸民，夷犹养得百年身。\n青山白水自邻里，霁月光风共主宾。\n醒眼看人浑弄拙，素心随份独全真。\n悠然一段安闲意，疑是羲皇以上人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21051,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"奉咏戒庵先生真率蓬窝","author":"蒋伟","text":"小结茅茨剩贮春，寻常风月自相亲。\n游行何必追康节，犹有温公会里人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21052,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"方丈篱落","author":"蒋伟","text":"疏英芳蕊自成丛，尽在庵庭跬步中。\n造化不嫌凭架小，年年先得领春风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21053,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杏花春雨","author":"蒋伟","text":"好花容易占春光，十二阑杆倚额妆。\n寄语曲江春燕子，共邀雨露待新郎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21054,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"桂子秋风","author":"蒋伟","text":"寒香万斛泻天风，仙种分明白月宫。\n十里红尘偏旖旎，伫看歧凤下秋丛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21055,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"盆荷生香","author":"蒋伟","text":"凿地埋盆莳玉莲，灵根窘迫叶田田。\n晚来一阵微风起，忽送清香满座前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21056,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拳石献笑","author":"蒋伟","text":"南阁拜台时已绝，渊明醉卧情犹偏。\n我欲与君宾作主，明月清风共莞然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21057,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"桃李争妍","author":"蒋伟","text":"谁将明暗说灵根，总是东皇一样神。\n悟取老花禅里意，元同碧落隔江春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21058,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"野芳竞秀","author":"蒋伟","text":"乾坤生意正当时，处处风光草木私。\n遮莫逢迎如献笑，人情物意恰相宜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21059,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"关情鸟语","author":"蒋伟","text":"呼雨啼晴春昼长，风亭水榭弄笙簧。\n莫言栖息榆枋下，拟控扶摇看颉颃。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21060,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"傲雪苍筠","author":"蒋伟","text":"谁移梁苑箨龙姿，十顷烟霞带碧漪。\n抚景漫裁司马赋，檀栾犹获紫端池。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21061,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"酬钱养心题菊","author":"李诩","text":"六阴复处已无阳，喜有黄花晚节香。\n遍插满头成故事，且倾初酿贺新妆。\n餐英已惯烹调法，和药应知性味凉。\n老我题诗寄同好，明年为种绕书堂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21062,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送浙帅张东野","author":"李诩","text":"依依衰柳思无穷，独抱琴书去棹东。\n为问江城近时事，天无日月目无瞳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21063,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渔父词","author":"李诩","text":"柳阴东傍系渔舟，恰对吴姬卖酒楼。\n便把钓来鲂与鲤，换将几斗醉船头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21064,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"壬戌仲秋有鹤自西北来集予舍，为赋来鹤篇","author":"李诩","text":"八月清秋飘桂香，忽有孤鹤横空翔。\n自北南来集予舍，从上下降迎朝阳。\n童子玩狎颇驯扰，舒颈引喙如相忘。\n予当读易北窗下，义文周孔同一堂。\n惊闻哄然整冠出，老幼诧怪争趋跄。\n朱颠突兀丹砂聚，白羽璀璨琼瑶光。\n有时张拱舞应节，有时长鸣协宫商。\n伴琴掠舟差可拟，挟仙缠跨羞与方。\n东坡诞感梦涉妄，卫懿乘轩陋禽荒。\n嗟予对之增感叹，俯首沈思几彷徨。\n一举千重平生志，豪门苑囿饱昂藏。\n胡为伥，不自择，戢羽故傍贫家郎。\n名为仙禽拙施计，颇类老朽空奔忙。\n鸣呼，会须一日奋飞翮，扶摇直上穹苍碧。\n纳新吐故寿千百，逍遥永伴蓬莱客。\n鹤乎，鹤乎，应汝职。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21065,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"伤吾地风俗之日，偷赋赤岸谣","author":"李诩","text":"赤岸溪头水下流，滔滔不尽杞人忧。\n徐行已作捐阶计，输粟翻为杀饷仇。\n豺虎啮人争变色，风涛簸日少安舟。\n岐周井里称亲睦，老眼于今不减愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21066,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"六旬初度自遣","author":"李诩","text":"花甲初周心尚童，少年侪伴忽称翁。\n壮图未遂金门献，清梦遥瞻紫阁重。\n陋巷朱门俱属幻，黄芽白雪谩成空。\n细推贤达惟居易，一任洪钧鼓铸功。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21067,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"张春野训果儿有作韵酬之","author":"李诩","text":"此心提醒要惺惺，百万军中鼓吹鸣。\n才有一毫私意蔽，便应千变恶机形。\n斋持务使神明守，培养先从定静生。\n圣训昭昭如白日，毋劳旁事短长铭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21068,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送文卿五卿两侄应试南都","author":"李诩","text":"献策都门道，秋光月正中。\n桂香迎去佩，剑气绕长空。\n报捷未为喜，连登始惬侬。\n吾宗久寥落，振起望双鸿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21069,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丙寅十月朔，扫墓有感","author":"李诩","text":"蓼莪篇废几潜然，聊率儿曹展墓田。\n乌鸟含情悲夜夜，春晖难报痛年年。\n箕裘未善惭弓冶，诗礼丕承扩祖先。\n所幸熙熙忘帝力，及时耕凿望孙贤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21070,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"甲申清明展墓有感","author":"李诩","text":"两弟峨峨一土丘，老兄瘦骨尚淹留。\n算来修短有数定，语及存亡空泪流。\n儿女痴愚当料理，田园便好莫营求。\n人生总是丝蚕样，到老登筐合罢休。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21071,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"癸巳五月辞世一首","author":"李诩","text":"天上星辰地海洋，细推今古事难量。\n神奇臭腐终黄土，今日安然卧夕阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21072,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"挽复庵第一律","author":"李桢","text":"髫龀相依已二毛，当年荼苦叹同遭。\n一从有阙廑匕补，几为无聊眷眷劳。\n浩兴只遗山水僻，闲情空忆啸歌豪。\n分飞雁影归何日，漫把相思付短毫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21073,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜感怀","author":"李桢","text":"伏枕难禁万斛愁，无端已是一年秋。\n悠悠行路谁知己，落落吾心与道谋。\n壮志未将酬马革，穷途空遣剩貂裘。\n何时献赋金门里，一醉高阳旧酒楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21074,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"香山寺","author":"吴重","text":"独步招提境，山窝弄白云。\n鹿麋当砌卧，钟磬隔花闻。\n厨水通飞瀑，春蔬撷野芹。\n遥看峰顶室，晻霭暮香焚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21075,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"喜雨","author":"郭士达","text":"积雨空山后，飞流树梢悬。\n绿欹初透竹，红没半开莲。\n五月寒侵葛，三农水护田。\n莫忧边饷急，帝已赐康年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21076,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"燕居","author":"郭士达","text":"寂寥杨子宅，元白绿窗虚。\n久病仍甘酒，多闲更嗜书。\n破巾宜短发，衰骨称深居。\n抱膝谁相傍，幽篁足草庐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21077,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春闺","author":"郭士达","text":"萋萋三春草，极目生烟雾。\n既感妾衷肠，莫断王孙路。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21078,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"征妇","author":"郭士达","text":"三年守空闺，年年裁尺素。\n作得辽阳书，遥阳八千路。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21079,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中夏晚晴","author":"郭士达","text":"雨歇日初坠，落霞明树颠。\n脱巾披白袷，倚柱看青天。\n归鸟急飞唤，孤云闲往还。\n游人入寥廓，回听惊鸣泉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21080,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧作","author":"郭士达","text":"雄心尽逐水东流，寸臆常容百斛愁。\n投璧有年终按剑，擒王无命不封侯。\n诗书玩日空黄卷，岁月驱人已白头。\n休把儒衣缠病骨，实将蓑笠下渔舟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21081,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题定僧壁","author":"郭士达","text":"嘉木芾繁荫，清响流高蝉。\n招提倚层障，方丈成孤悬。\n中有远公座，面壁馀枯禅。\n但见鸟去来，不闻人往还。\n石床净如玉，花雨徒相湔。\n身本与空并，空中复何缘。\n说法即非法，是法故忘诠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21082,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"积雨初霁与客夜谈，用王文学韵","author":"郭士达","text":"为厌经旬雨，偏宜一晚晴。\n草依华露湿，月入淡烟明。\n珠玉风前话，关山笛里声。\n清宵与良晤，一往足深情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21083,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同孙汝师过其亡弟元升园中次韵","author":"周元晟","text":"处事元如寄，浮生疑即归。\n床头琴绝响，灯下泪停挥。\n斤斧侵乔木，莓苔掩旧扉。\n秋霜惊满鬓，堪惜故人稀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21084,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送陆无咎入楚","author":"周元晟","text":"岂意云间胄，翻从谪戍行。\n囊中携白雪，腰下佩青萍。\n烈士心逾壮，吾侪气未平。\n湘江多雁唳，欲恐易愁生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21085,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柬李仲达","author":"周元晟","text":"早岁登高第，宁亲返故墟。\n岂期轩冕客，能访薜萝居。\n闭户经年久，支床累用馀。\n温言劳问讯，车马耀蓬庐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21086,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬夜病中述怀","author":"周元晟","text":"病入膏肓久，难求海上丹。\n灯销通夕暗，衾敝五更寒。\n辗转繁愁集，呻吟百病攒。\n褰帷看曙色，残月照阑干。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21087,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日沈飞霞以茶箸见惠","author":"周元晟","text":"别来何处卧烟霞，屈指频惊改岁华。\n才乏运筹休借箸，病同消渴喜分茶。\n千林欲落迎霜叶，三径将开冒雨花。\n紫蟹浊醪堪共醉，独怜踪迹隔天涯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21088,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"惜川鹃","author":"周元晟","text":"血染枝头万点红，春来日日对芳丛。\n繁华有尽经销歇，憔悴今怜似主翁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21089,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"遣怀","author":"周元晟","text":"骨瘦形枯壮气销，侧身天地混渔樵。\n翻云覆雨寻常事，风月偏能伴寂寥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21090,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"奉挽复庵赠君一律","author":"周元晟","text":"愁云漠漠泪沄沄，梦寐犹沾笑语温。\n灯下岂能重话旧，花间无复共倾尊。\n论文累世空衔德，落魄浮生未报恩。\n有子从来称不死，伫看双凤并腾鶱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21091,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"茆屋","author":"吴法","text":"茆椽近野田，亭午见炊烟。\n稚笋穿篱出，夭桃傍水妍。\n云霞诸岭近，鸡犬数家连。\n睍睆闻黄鸟，清于弄管弦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21092,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"勖九子","author":"吴法","text":"尔辈何为者，朋来至九人。\n螽蝗洵聚类，粱黍费盈囷。\n问世先求己，穷编耐受辛。\n谋生非易事，即此是经纶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21093,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丙寅夜扶仲弟柩南还途次泣成","author":"李应炅","text":"追忆平生痛雉罹，那知分手竟如斯。\n爨湮逼几咿唔日，缇骑临门慷慨时。\n身到尽忠方尽孝，人如吾弟是吾师。\n泫然有泪凭谁洒，旅榇归魂好共随。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21094,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"贺建济砚弟游庠","author":"周九鼎","text":"江城英发各为群，年少才高独冠军。\n三试词章明锦丽，一腔心地妙香薰。\n早占门第能绳武，况值岩廊正右文。\n伊昔鸡窗共灯火，摩挲老眼望青云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21095,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"槐叶","author":"吴廷栋","text":"槐叶一株碧，清斋净俗心。\n友疏无札到，诗就有僧吟。\n细雨收残照，归鸦聚晚林。\n渐于郊市远，山水自高深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21096,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"周凉武、克力两公招饮承恩堂同赋","author":"吴芳标","text":"江寒山墅暮阴阴，一夕乾坤此共吟。\n酒湿裙衫银盏乱，帘垂灯火柳堂深。\n梅花白借三年鬓，春雨愁浇半夜心。\n自是诗成前辈好，后生真觉愧清音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21097,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送爱吾周先生赴馆泾里","author":"吴芳楫","text":"南塘春涨一篙轻，匣剑囊琴趁晓行。\n遁迹肯同秦二士，授经还似汉诸生。\n青山对酒梅花发，绛帐论文镜月清。\n此去陶城多俊杰，熊熊头角熟先鸣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21098,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"追悼庄烈帝","author":"吴芳权","text":"先王俭德从来少，声色何曾进御前。\n饥馑荐臻兵更逼，恬嬉沿误鼎随迁。\n忧民实下千行泪，传警常惊一夜眠。\n遥望园陵风雨夕，六龙肃肃尚行天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21099,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吊邑殉难诸人","author":"吴芳权","text":"连州列郡尽离披，独有弹丸誓不移。\n谁肯土崩图苟免，犹能巷斗力相持。\n千人毅魄凭天堑，万众雄心限地维。\n闻说中秋临死夕，琵琶箫鼓闹城陴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21100,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"祝古槐兄八十","author":"吴芳权","text":"渭水滩头一钓翁，理丝不问世穷通。\n芦花掩映三洲棹，竹叶萧疏半亩宫。\n客至不修花卉节，筵开自率素家风。\n由来天爵人人贵，何必从王勒鼎功。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21101,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同里中耆士登文选楼二首 其一","author":"吴旸","text":"昭明遗迹在，有客款禅扉。\n文藻垂千载，楼台空夕晖。\n但留题壁句，莫惜和人稀。\n伊昔栖迟地，年衰杖履违。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21102,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同里中耆士登文选楼二首 其二","author":"吴旸","text":"梁代前星耀，鸾旂指石扉。\n丹黄披丙籍，草木被春晖。\n殿圮檐椽折，僧寒钟梵稀。\n诸公念芳躅，修葺愿毋违。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21103,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"示学者","author":"缪思勃","text":"气盈天地间，上清而下浊。\n收得清气归，心胸自开拓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21104,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"老梅","author":"缪思勃","text":"冰雪倍经过，侵淩奈老何。\n春风怜爱否，披拂也应多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21105,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寿岸生从叔六十","author":"缪思勃","text":"卜屋缘溪一斗方，安身仍是旧柴桑。\n居然六十添华发，撑住梅花度暗香。\n风雨莫惊翻累瓦，烟霞常为护穿床。\n鹿裘带索浑无事，祖武还须授二郎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21106,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄金沙史淩霄","author":"缪思勃","text":"萍水交欢遇亦奇，性情疏豁实相宜。\n心亲何必常晨夕，地远将无太别离。\n我是恨人空皓首，君真名士正清时。\n即今彩翼冲天去，除却河东更数谁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21107,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荫千赵生游庠志喜","author":"缪思勃","text":"曾携书卷到茅堂，春韭秋菘共饱尝。\n昨夜灯花先有信，令人还忆旧青箱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21108,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与钱匏园交最久诗以纪之","author":"缪思勃","text":"风雨交亲四十年，每于吟眺思无边。\n胸藏无数古今事，咳唾成珠颗颗圆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21109,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]